        <mxCell id="b3" value="转移：pending = frame    L487&lt;br&gt;input_mutex 保护；此处起归编码线程负责" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
